ed crop management toward data-driven precision crop management."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Field Observation","Farmer Experience","Crop Management"]},{"type":"h","text":"Future model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Soil Sensors","Satellite Data","Weather","Crop Models","AI → Field-Specific Recommendations"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future agronomists will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agronomy","Soil Science","GIS","Remote Sensing","Agricultural Data","Climate Science"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core agriculture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agronomy","Crop Physiology","Soil Science","Plant Nutrition"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Crop management"},{"type":"flow","items":["Irrigation","Weed Management","Crop Protection","Cropping Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["Experimental Design","Statistics","Field Trials"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital agriculture"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","Remote Sensing","GPS","Sensors"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","R/Python","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Future skills"},{"type":"flow","items":["Precision Agriculture","AI","Crop Modelling","Climate-Smart Agriculture"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Fieldwork","Farmer Communication","Technical Reporting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Year 1","Agricultural Science + Botany + Soil Fundamentals","Year 2","Agronomy + Crop Production + Plant Nutrition + Irrigation","Year 3","Field Trials + Weed/Crop Management + Agricultural Statistics","Year 4","Precision Agriculture + GIS + Remote Sensing + Data Analytics","Graduation","Agronomy Assistant / Field Assistant","3–5 Years","Agronomist / Crop Specialist","5–10 Years","Senior Agronomist / Agricultural Specialist","10–15+ Years","Agronomy Manager / Research Specialist","15+ Years","Head of Agronomy / Agricultural Operations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Agricultural Science (General) → Agronomy Assistant, the strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agronomy","Soil & Plant Nutrition","Crop Production","Irrigation","Field Trials","Agricultural Statistics","GIS/Remote Sensing","Precision Agriculture"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The degree provides a broad agricultural foundation, while field experience is particularly important at the assistant level. Adding precision-agriculture and data skills later allows the graduate to move from routine field support into higher-value crop analytics, agronomy consulting, research and agricultural technology roles."}]}]}